            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\frac{x-2}{2}-\\frac{5}{x-2}\"></span> ,  тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}=\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{25}{(x-2)^{2}}-5\"></span>.  Далее имеем:<center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2(t^{2}+5)=t+16\\iff 2t^{2}-t-6=0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t=2\\\\t=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Вер­нем­ся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x-2}{2}-\\frac{5}{x-2}=2\\\\\\frac{x-2}{2}-\\frac{5}{x-2}=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\iff \\begin{cases}x\\ne 2\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2}-10=4x-8\\\\(x-2)^{2}-10=-3x+6\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff\"></span> </p></center><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}x\\ne 2\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}x^{2}-8x+2=0\\\\x^{2}-x-12=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=4-\\sqrt{14}\\\\x=4+\\sqrt{14}\\\\x=-3\\\\x=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Вы­яс­ним, какие из най­ден­ных кор­ней при­над­ле­жат от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[3;8]\"></span> . В силу не­ра­венств <center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"4\\lt 4+\\sqrt{14}\\lt 4+4=8\"></span> и <span data-inline-latex=\"4-\\sqrt{14}\\lt 4-3=1\\lt 3\"></span>,</p></center><p>из най­ден­ных кор­ней урав­не­ния за­дан­но­му от­рез­ку при­над­ле­жат толь­ко числа <span data-inline-latex=\"4\"></span> и <span data-inline-latex=\"4+\\sqrt{14}\"></span> .</p></li></ol>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
          "schema_version": 3,
